---
import SiteMenuBehaviour from "../../components/SiteMenuBehaviour.astro";
import SiteNavigation from "../../components/SiteNavigation.astro";
import { TREATMENT_PAGES, BOOKING_URL, WHATSAPP_URL, DIRECTIONS_URL } from "../../data/site";
const path = "/skin-concerns/acne-scarring-fareham/";
const title = "Acne Scarring & Skin Texture in Fareham | Forever Young Beauty";
const description = "Explore skincare for acne-prone skin, the appearance of certain acne scars and uneven texture in Fareham. Learn about microneedling and Layla's treatment approach.";
const canonical = "https://foreveryoungbeautybylayla.co.uk" + path;
const schema = {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":title,"description":description,"url":canonical,"about":[{"@type":"Thing","name":"Acne scarring"},{"@type":"Thing","name":"Uneven skin texture"}],"isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"Forever Young Beauty by Layla","url":"https://foreveryoungbeautybylayla.co.uk/"}};
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/><meta name="robots" content="index,follow"/><meta property="og:title" content={title}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/><meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} /></head>
<body>
<header class="top"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Forever Young Beauty homepage"><strong>Forever Young Beauty</strong><span>by Layla</span></a><a class="corner-logo" href="/" aria-label="Return to homepage"><img src="/images/fyb-wordmark-1.png" alt="Forever Young Beauty logo" width="62" height="62" loading="eager" /></a><details class="menu"><summary aria-label="Open site menu"><span class="hamburger" aria-hidden="true">☰</span></summary><SiteNavigation currentPath={path} /></details></header>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="inner"><p class="eyebrow">Skincare at Abshot Country Club · Titchfield Common</p><h1>Acne Scarring &amp; Skin Texture Treatments in Fareham</h1><p class="lead">Still noticing marks after acne, or feeling frustrated by uneven skin texture? You're not alone. Let's look at the treatments that may help with the appearance of acne marks, certain scars and uneven texture — and what might suit your skin.</p><a class="button" href={BOOKING_URL}>Book on Treatwell</a></div></section>
<div class="content">
<section><h2>Acne, acne marks and acne scars are not the same</h2><p>Active breakouts, lingering discolouration and changes in skin texture can need different approaches. Some depressed acne scars may respond to professional treatments, but not every type of scarring is suitable for a beauty treatment. No treatment can promise to erase scars completely.</p></section>
<section><h2>Microneedling for the appearance of certain acne scars</h2><p>Microneedling is one option for improving the appearance of certain acne scars, uneven texture and fine lines. Microneedling creates controlled micro-injuries to encourage the skin's natural repair response. It may improve the appearance of some depressed acne scars, but results vary and assessment is important.</p><p>Read more about <a href="/treatments/microneedling-fareham/">microneedling in Fareham, including suitability and aftercare</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>See microneedling in action</h2><p>Take a look at microneedling in action and learn why it can be considered for certain types of acne scarring. Results vary from person to person.</p><video controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/videos/Acne_Scarring_Microneedling-poster.png" aria-label="Layla demonstrating microneedling skincare" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:420px;aspect-ratio:9/16;object-fit:contain;background:#142c3a;border-radius:12px;margin:1rem auto"><source src="/videos/Acne_Scarring_Microneedling.mp4" type="video/mp4"/>Your browser does not support this video.</video></section>
<section><h2>BioRePeelCl3 chemical peels and acne-prone skin</h2><p>BioRePeelCl3 is a TCA-based chemical peel that may be considered for some concerns associated with acne-prone skin. In one client example, a course of five peels was followed by a resurfacing treatment after the breakouts had settled. Every skin journey is different, so treatment choice and number of sessions depend on individual needs. Please check which peels are currently available and suitable for your skin.</p></section>
<section><h2>SkinBase microdermabrasion and surface texture</h2><p>SkinBase microdermabrasion gently exfoliates the surface of the skin and may help it feel smoother once active breakouts have settled. It is not a treatment for deep acne scars. Ask about current availability and whether resurfacing would suit your skin.</p></section>
<section><h2>What should I consider before booking?</h2><p>Before we decide on a treatment, I'd love to hear about your skin, your usual routine and anything that's been bothering you. Please tell me about active acne, irritation, medication or previous treatments too. Active inflamed acne, infection or other conditions may make some treatments unsuitable. Raised or complex scars, severe acne or persistent symptoms may warrant assessment by a GP or dermatologist.</p><p>For independent information, see <a href="https://www.aad.org/public/diseases/acne/derm-treat/scars/treatment" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">the American Academy of Dermatology's acne scar treatment guidance</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>Skincare near Fareham, Locks Heath and Whiteley</h2><p>Forever Young Beauty by Layla is based at Abshot Country Club, Little Abshot Road, Titchfield Common, Fareham PO14 4LN, convenient for Park Gate, Stubbington, Warsash and nearby Hampshire communities. <a href="/our-location/">See directions and location details</a>.</p></section>
<section aria-labelledby="client-reviews"><h2 id="client-reviews">What clients say about Layla</h2><p>A few words from clients who have visited Forever Young Beauty. These reviews are about their overall experience, rather than acne-scar treatment results.</p><blockquote><p>“Layla is very professional, caring and friendly. She makes sure you are comfortable and relaxed during the treatment. I will definitely be returning on a regular basis.”</p><footer>— Corinne, CACI facial · Treatwell verified review</footer></blockquote><blockquote><p>“Layla is amazing! I have had loads of facials over the years, however this was by far the best. Layla is diligent, knowledgeable and is a wonderful therapist. Thank you!”</p><footer>— Maxine, facial · Google review</footer></blockquote><p>Read more customer feedback directly on <a href="https://www.treatwell.co.uk/place/forever-young-beauty-by-layla/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Layla's Treatwell listing</a>. </p></section>
<section class="contact"><h2>Discuss your skin concerns with Layla</h2><p>For current treatment options and appointment availability, use Treatwell. For questions about whether a treatment suits your skin, contact Layla directly on WhatsApp.</p><p><a class="button" href={BOOKING_URL}>Book on Treatwell</a></p><div class="contact-actions"><a class="contact-action maps-action" href={DIRECTIONS_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Directions on Google Maps</a><a class="contact-action whatsapp-action" href={WHATSAPP_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp Layla</a></div></section>
<nav aria-label="Other treatments"><h2>Explore more treatments</h2><div class="links">{TREATMENT_PAGES.map(t => <a href={t.href}>{t.label}</a>)}</div></nav>
</div></main><footer><a href="/">Forever Young Beauty by Layla</a> · Titchfield Common, Fareham</footer><SiteMenuBehaviour /><script src="/booking-tracking.js" defer></script>
</body></html>
